  maxHealth: 220
  contactDamage: 2
  scoreReward: 3000
  description: A wall of meat that grew its own castle. Everything the Behemoth has
    ever walked through is part of its back now.
  tactics: Accelerating fans, massive slow walls, offset and dense rings across three
    phases. Its bullets are heavy but sparse - the fight is about patience, not reflexes.
    Punish the long recovery after each wall; by Meltdown (red glow) the floor is
    mostly bullets, so pre-plan lanes.
